  "texts": {
    "preamble": "B. Vishnu Vardhan, vs The State Of Adnrha Pradesh, on 20 October, 2021 In The High Court Of Andhra Pradesh At Amaravath Wednesday, The Twentieth Day Of October Two Thousand And Twenty One 'Present: The Honourable Smt Justice Lalitha Kanneganti Criminal Petition No: 5702 Of 2021 ra Between: B. Vishnu Vardhan, S/o. Varaprasad, Hindu, 32 year, R/o. 2-8, sajjavaripaliem, alaparru, Gunrur District. ) } Petitioner/Accused -16 AND The State of Andhra Pradesh, Rep. by its Public Prosecutor High Court Buildings, Amaravathi.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that petitioner is innocent and he has not committed any offence and nothing has been. seized from the possession of petitioner. He submits that products which are being transported will not fall under the definition as per Section 3{j} of FSS Act. He submits that cigarettes, chewing tobacco, pan masala and chewing material with tobacco are a i, te neteag . included in the tobacco products, which are only defined under COTPA and not under FSS Act. m 5,",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that petitioner is innocent and he has not committed any offence and nothing has been. seized from the possession of petitioner. He submits that products which are being transported will not fall under the definition as per Section 3{j} of FSS Act. He submits that cigarettes, chewing tobacco, pan masala and chewing material with tobacco are a i, te neteag . included in the tobacco products, which are only defined under COTPA and not under FSS Act. m 5,",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
